# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets — .assetsignore (gitignore syntax, relative to the assets dir = dist)
# Purpose: keep the static-asset upload under Cloudflare's 20,000-file limit by EXCLUDING the bulk
# content images, which are served from R2 instead (the layouts prepend PUBLIC_IMG_BASE).
# heroes/ + cities/ are NOT excluded — hub pages (gen-hubs) still reference them as static /images/.
#
# ACTIVATION (do ONLY after R2 is uploaded AND PUBLIC_IMG_BASE is set, else content images 404):
#   cp _internal/assetsignore.for-cutover astro/public/.assetsignore
#   git add astro/public/.assetsignore && commit && push   # next Cloudflare build deploys under the limit
#
# File counts: total dist ≈ 22,400 (over limit). Excluding hotels(7,693)+cm(3,216)+food(80)+gallery(1)
# leaves ≈ 11,400 static files (html + heroes/cities + non-image public) → under 20,000. ✓
images/hotels/
images/cm/
images/food/
images/gallery/
